  "_doc": "Single source of truth for NutriAI 30s promo timing. Frames at 30 fps. Scene cuts sit on a 112.5 BPM beat grid (1 beat = 16 frames, 1 bar = 64 frames). Both the animation (render.mjs) and the audio (audio/build_audio.py) read this file, so every SFX hit and narration chunk lands on the same frame as its visual action.",
